$CATEGORY: Odyssey1

::Q01::[markdown]Which god is angry at Odysseus? {=Poseidon}

::Q02::[markdown]Whom did Aegisthus kill? {=Agamemnon}

::Q03::[markdown]Who killed Aegisthus? {=Orestes}

::Q04::[markdown]What was Poseidon's blinded son's name? {=Polyphemus =Cyclops}

::Q05::[markdown]What is Odysseus' island home? {=Ithaca}

::Q06::[markdown]Who plays a zither in Odysseus' house? {=Phemius}

::Q06::[markdown]Who is Anchialus' son? {=Mentes}

::Q07::[markdown]Who says, "No one witnesses his own begetting"? {=Telemachus}

::Q08::[markdown]Telemachus mentions a cluster of islands, including "Rocky Ithaca": Doulichium, Samē, and "wooded" {=Zacynthus}.

::Q09::[markdown]If you need deadly poison for arrowheads, Mermerus’s son, {=Ilus}, is your go-to guy.

::Q10::[markdown]If you want to sail to Pylos, you need your best ship and how many oarsmen? {=twenty =20}

::Q11::[markdown]What color is Menelaus' hair? {=red =Red}

::Q12::[markdown]Did you notice that Athena explicitly mentions Orestes to Telemachus? {=yes =Yes}

::Q13::[markdown]Which god, according to the "great harper" "ordained hard journeys… for the Greeks on their way back from Troy?" {=Pallas Athena =Athena}

::Q14::[markdown]Who is Penelope's father (this will be important)? {=Icarius}

::Q15::[markdown]"All through the shadowy halls the suitors broke into an uproar, each of them praying to lie in bed with [Penelope]." Do you pinky-swear to spend a few moments reflecting on how truly messed up this would be for Telemachus, to have, basically, a drunken frat-house of guys constantly hitting on his mother? How dangerous? The correct answer is "yes". {=yes}

::Q16::[markdown]Who is the daughter of Ops? {=Eurycleia}

::Q17::[markdown]And she is whose granddaughter? {=Peisenor}

::Q18::[markdown]Note that she is a slave in the household of Odysseus, but the poem *cares about her*, giving us her ancestry. Did you note that? The correct answer is "yes" {=yes}

